"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The First Conditional ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the first conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else will happen.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " You can start the sentence with <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span> and <span class=\"italic\">once</span> to say what the result will be when we do something or after we finish an action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Clause \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If you cook the meat too long, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it will burn. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you will cook the meat too long. In this condition: it will burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I ask the teacher to help me,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible I will ask the teacher to help me. In this condition: I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If he gets a high-paying job,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he can go on a vacation twice a year.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible he will get a high-paying job. In this condition: he can go on vacation twice a year.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "After I pass my test, I will look for a better job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " When I get a high-paying job, I might need to buy new work clothes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Once I start making a lot of money, I will go on a cruise.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "anxious", "type": "name"}, {"content": " being afraid or nervous about what may happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'm anxious about my test coming up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are some words you use to talk about your job or career.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "relieved ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling relaxed and happy because something difficult passed/finished ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm so relieved my test is done.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Guess what? ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "You say this before you tell someone something interesting or surprising to catch their attention.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Guess what? I just got a new job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "investment firm ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a company that uses your money to buy stock in another company to make more money ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter's business skills helped him get a job in an investment firm.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I'll take it. ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "You say this when we decide to purchase an item or accept an offer. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The company offered me the job. I think I'll take it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "career ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a job for a number of years in the field you choose ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I look forward to starting my career with this company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "That's it. ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "You say this to mean there is no more of something or to finish a conversation. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:<br> <span class=\"strong\">Susan</span>: Is there anything else I need to know?<br><span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: No. That's it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write an e-mail to a friend telling them that you got a new job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain why you accepted the job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain to your friends what you will miss from your old job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use first conditional sentences.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write an e-mail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about future possibilities.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_i