ith &#60;peter.smith@mail.com&#62; wrote:</span><br>\nHey, John. I hope you're well. You were right. I passed all my exams with flying colors. I was so anxious, but now I am so relieved. However, I'm not going on a cruise just yet. Guess what? I received a call the other day from a recruiter about a job at a large investment firm. It sounds really promising. I think I'll take it.</p>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le07ob02re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"italic\">On Feb 25, at 10:20 PM, John Harris &#60;John.Harris@mail.com&#62; wrote:</span><br>\nHey, Peter. That's fabulous. Congratulations. It's OK about the cruise. I'm sure you'll come later. Once you take this job, you'll be on the fast track in your career.</p>", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "image": "engenn5le07ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"italic\">On Feb 26, at 7:12 AM, Peter Smith &#60;peter.smith@mail.com&#62; wrote:</span><br>\nThanks, John. If I take this job, I'll be saying goodbye to MechaTech. After I leave, I'll really miss Amanda, my partner here. I'll let you know what happens. That's it for now.</p>", "id": 3, "time": "36500", "image": "engenn5le07ob02re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le07ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le07ob02re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}